# Defence-in-depth for the serving+landing image (fix/composer-cosmos). The
# Dockerfile already COPYs exact subpaths (never `COPY .`, never a truth/ tree),
# so this only trims the build context sent to the daemon — but truth/, data/ and
# secrets are excluded here too, so a future broad COPY cannot regress silently.
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the root one.
.git
data
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
dbt
dbt/target
dbt/logs
logs
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.claude
tests
docs
specs
**/.terraform
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
# Truth is never part of a serving image (truth isolation): the write-back reads
# BigQuery `ontime`, the landing reads raw/+dims/ only.
**/truth
# Secrets must never be baked (matches .gitignore's block, `**/`-anchored).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.p8
**/*-key.json
**/*-credentials.json
**/credentials*
**/service-account*.json
